    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938020/extras/d9d0c34ba8c4771a4430989feb464937.poster.avif?t=1727449382\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938020/extras/d9d0c34ba8c4771a4430989feb464937.webm?t=1727449382\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938020/extras/d9d0c34ba8c4771a4430989feb464937.mp4?t=1727449382\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Enter the Bomb-Filled Arena of Bombergrounds: Classic!</strong><br>Prepare for explosive, fast-paced action where every battle is packed with chaos! Whether you\u2019re playing solo or teaming up with friends, the battlefield is yours to conquer in this wild, adrenaline-pumping experience inspired by classic battle games. Do you have what it takes to dominate the competition?<br><br>Key Features:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Play Solo or With Friends:</strong> Whether you prefer to go it alone or team up with your friends, Bombergrounds has you covered. Show off your skills in both modes!<br></li><li><strong>League Progression:</strong> Keep winning, collect trophies, and show off your hard-earned rewards.<br></li><li><strong>Leaderboards:</strong> Compete against the best\u2014locally and globally. Will you rise as a predator or fall as prey?<br></li><li><strong>Skins and Swag:</strong> Customize your character with the coolest skins. Stand out from the crowd and let your style shine on the battlefield.</li></ul><br>Jump into the explosive world of online multiplayer battle royale chaos. With cute and colorful designs, unlock tons of cosmetics and emotes, and experience the thrill of fast-paced combat.<br><br>Bombergrounds: Classic isn\u2019t just a game\u2014it\u2019s a bombastic, laugh-out-loud arena where only the sharpest players survive. Are you ready to rule the battleground?",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938020/extras/d9d0c34ba8c4771a4430989feb464937.poster.avif?t=1727449382\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938020/extras/d9d0c34ba8c4771a4430989feb464937.webm?t=1727449382\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938020/extras/d9d0c34ba8c4771a4430989feb464937.mp4?t=1727449382\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Enter the Bomb-Filled Arena of Bombergrounds: Classic!</strong><br>Prepare for explosive, fast-paced action where every battle is packed with chaos! Whether you\u2019re playing solo or teaming up with friends, the battlefield is yours to conquer in this wild, adrenaline-pumping experience inspired by classic battle games. Do you have what it takes to dominate the competition?<br><br>Key Features:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Play Solo or With Friends:</strong> Whether you prefer to go it alone or team up with your friends, Bombergrounds has you covered. Show off your skills in both modes!<br></li><li><strong>League Progression:</strong> Keep winning, collect trophies, and show off your hard-earned rewards.<br></li><li><strong>Leaderboards:</strong> Compete against the best\u2014locally and globally. Will you rise as a predator or fall as prey?<br></li><li><strong>Skins and Swag:</strong> Customize your character with the coolest skins. Stand out from the crowd and let your style shine on the battlefield.</li></ul><br>Jump into the explosive world of online multiplayer battle royale chaos. With cute and colorful designs, unlock tons of cosmetics and emotes, and experience the thrill of fast-paced combat.<br><br>Bombergrounds: Classic isn\u2019t just a game\u2014it\u2019s a bombastic, laugh-out-loud arena where only the sharpest players survive. Are you ready to rule the battleground?",
